  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After falling into Lu Wei Yin’s illusory sand shifting shadow battlefield, Spectral Soul attacks at once instead of defending. He distracts Fang Yuan with words while preparing a killer move that has no aura or commotion, an aspect only Wu Yong in the current five regions could match, then grabs Fang Yuan’s neck tightly. Gu Immortal battles rarely use close combat; most fight at long distance, and only a few paths such as transformation path or strength path focus on hand-to-hand combat. He keeps the method rather than discarding it. When it activates, the Fang Yuan in his hand turns into sand and scatters with the wind; it is a puppet made of sand.",
